### ChaloAuto API (VS Code REST Client). Run seed first: npm run seed
@base = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Log in as a seeded passenger (dev test OTP 123456) -> copy "token" into @token below
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "+919999000001", "otp": "123456", "role": "PASSENGER" }

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Routes with their points (shown on the map)
GET {{base}}/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Request a ride (pickup + drop-off must be within 1 km of the same route)
POST {{base}}/rides/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pickupLat": 28.6304, "pickupLng": 77.2177, "dropLat": 28.5921, "dropLng": 77.1659 }

### 4. Current rides
GET {{base}}/rides/passenger/PASTE_USER_ID/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Rate a completed ride
POST {{base}}/rides/rate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rideId": "PASTE_RIDE_ID", "rating": 5, "comment": "Smooth ride" }

### 6. Update profile
PUT {{base}}/users/PASTE_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Asha" }

### 7. Simulation results (public)
GET {{base}}/simulation/summary
